  "methods": {
    "primary_cases": "Seven 20 s trials. At t=2 s apply command, set to zero at t=15 s. 1 environment, seed 42, no pushes, plane, student with estimated velocity, Native. All other trained dynamics randomization retained.",
    "control_windows": "All scenario CSV metrics unless suffixed use control indices 200..749 (4 <= t < 15 s) and omit reset samples. Yaw is body z rate. Heading is unwrapped quaternion yaw change between steps 100 and 749; XY net movement is world-position displacement from just before command to step 749. Post-stop metrics use 17..20 s and can be from a new episode after a reset.",
